/// trace graph describes services that process incoming requests and any
/// downstream services they call, which may include Amazon Web Services
/// resources, external APIs, or databases. The response is empty until the
/// RetrievalStatus is COMPLETE . Retry the request after the status changes
/// from RUNNING or SCHEDULED to COMPLETE to access the full service graph.
